</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Be Thou supreme, O Jesus Christ,</l><l>Thy love has conquered me;</l><l>Beneath Thy Cross I die to self,</l><l>And live alone to Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Be Thou supreme, O Jesus Christ,</l><l>My inmost being fill;</l><l>So shall I think as Thou dost think,</l><l>And will as Thou dost will.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Be Thou supreme, O Jesus Christ,</l><l>Thy life transfigure mine;</l><l>And through this veil of mortal flesh,</l><l>Lord, let Thy splendor shine.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Be Thou supreme, O Jesus Christ,</l><l>My soul exults in Thee;</l><l>To be Thy slave, to do Thy will,</l><l>Is my felicity.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
